      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MORF (1) pulled up with a couple of issues last time but importantly drops back to 1100m today. He was a good winner at this track and trip three starts back and draws the inside gate again. Can find the front under Tsang and make every post a winner. ALEBRIJE (2) went to Pinjarra last start and failed after a good win here two starts ago. Riordan's claim comes in handy today and the wide draw doesn't hurt with her racing pattern. Well placed here on her win two back and she can return to form. LOVESEXY (8) was out of the money two runs back then again missed the frame last start over 1100m at this track, beaten 1.4 lengths into fourth. Stepping up a level this time but on her best form she is capable of a big performance. WHITE HOT (5) was out of the money two runs back then again missed the frame last start over 1400m at this track, beaten 1.5 lengths into seventh. Nicely placed to find some form. DANCE VERSION (4) can go on with the job following a first-up win.",
